                            <strong>Character Development</strong>
                            <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Sarah's backstory ideas</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="thread-item">
                            <strong>Plot Holes</strong>
                            <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Timeline inconsistencies</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="thread-item">
                            <strong>World Building</strong>
                            <div class="text-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Lighthouse history</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chat-main">
                        <div class="chat-messages">
                            <div class="message">
                                <div class="message-avatar">S</div>
                                <div class="message-content">
                                    <strong>You</strong>
                                    <p>I need help developing Sarah's backstory. She's discovering this mysterious lighthouse, but I'm not sure what would motivate her to investigate it.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="message ai">
                                <div class="message-avatar">AI</div>
                                <div class="message-content">
                                    <strong>Assistant</strong>
                                    <p>Here are some compelling backstory options for Sarah's motivation:</p>
